    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/f38f87023535bbdb5215a8d13de9d41a.poster.avif?t=1742277570\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/f38f87023535bbdb5215a8d13de9d41a.webm?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/f38f87023535bbdb5215a8d13de9d41a.mp4?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>David has been trapped on his family's farm his whole life. When his parents suddenly leave the valley, everything changes. David must move into town and... go to college! The story follows the day to day life of David as he embarks upon his adult independence. He will pursue his studies, chase beautiful women, and maybe even save the valley!<br><br>Fantasy Valley is a point and click visual novel. The reader clicks around the screen to move from scene to scene, talk with characters, and explore objects. The story is linear with moments of exploration sprinkled in. Occasional dialogue options give the reader a chance to express their personality, but these choices will not affect how the story pans out.\u200b<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/325fca4766534538183087523d9450f3.poster.avif?t=1742277570\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/325fca4766534538183087523d9450f3.webm?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/325fca4766534538183087523d9450f3.mp4?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>David has spent his entire life confined to his family's farm. When his parents unexpectedly leave the valley, everything changes. David must relocate to town and... attend college! The story chronicles David's daily life as he embarks on his journey toward adult independence. He will pursue his studies, chase beautiful women, and perhaps even save the valley!<br><br>The story is linear with occasional moments of exploration. Dialogue options allow readers to express their personality, but these choices do not alter the overall storyline in the long term.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantasy Valley - Season 1 Includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chapter 1 - 90 Minutes of Gameplay <br></li><li>Chapter 2 - 70 Minutes of Gameplay<br></li><li>Chapter 3 - 60 Minutes of Gameplay<br></li><li>Chapter 4 - 80 Minutes of Gameplay<br></li><li>Chapter 5 - 90 Minutes of Gameplay</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/21889c0df415915d9ce669b7f940360e.poster.avif?t=1742277570\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/21889c0df415915d9ce669b7f940360e.webm?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/21889c0df415915d9ce669b7f940360e.mp4?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive Storytelling: Experience a compelling narrative as David navigates the challenges of adult independence.<br></li><li>Interactive Gameplay: Engage with characters and environments through intuitive point-and-click mechanics.<br></li><li>Romance and Relationships: Pursue romantic interests and build relationships with diverse characters.<br></li><li>Exploration: Discover hidden secrets and explore various locations within the town and valley.</li></ul><br>Join David on his journey and explore a world filled with adventure, romance, and self-discovery in &quot;Fantasy Valley.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/3af8c30d7399d90e7f2935d3e0e48349.poster.avif?t=1742277570\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047490/extras/3af8c30d7399d90e7f2935d3e0e48349.webm?t=1742277570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Fantasy Valley - Season 2 will continue the story and be released and sold separately as DLC.",
